{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50773","headline":"题弋阳徐明府水亭 · 张祜","name":"题弋阳徐明府水亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小邑不劳贤，心期胜地偏。\n树微青嶂耸，沙浅碧波旋。\n荡桨投昏岸，烧燔指湿烟。\n板檐傍眺寺，石路上登舡。\n水槛推衣浴，风轩侧枕眠。\n无因长寄此，吟和酒中仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50773.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50773","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}